Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:34:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] UIQ-4: the theme toggle acts on the first press when the
 device is in dark mode

On "system" the header always offered dark, so a phone already dark stored
dark and changed nothing. The client reads the device preference into the
header control and tells the palette toggle what is on screen.

